  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/PobreDeMi17SantJoaaquim1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(20 fotos) La nit d&#39;aquest diumenge han acabat, amb el cant del &#39;Pobre de mi&#39; i la interpretraci&oacute; del Silenci a la trompeta, les festes del barri de sant Joaquim, a Onda, que van comen&ccedil;ar divendres 18 d&#39;agost.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17diumnegeultim/img_4399.jpg\" alt=\"img_4399\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17diumnegeultim/img_4404.jpg\" alt=\"img_4404\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17diumnegeultim/img_4408.jpg\" alt=\"img_4408\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17diumnegeultim/img_4409.jpg\" alt=\"img_4409\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17diumnegeultim/img_4411.jpg\" alt=\"img_4411\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17diumnegeultim/img_4412.jpg\" alt=\"img_4412\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17diumnegeultim/img_4417.jpg\" alt=\"img_4417\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17diumnegeultim/img_4420.jpg\" alt=\"img_4420\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/santxoxim17diumnegeultim/img_4423.jpg\" alt=\"img_4423\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715